 "text": "Hi, how have you been? You don't look stupid, and eating in nice place is an outing, not race. Eating and listening is what it for. Forks are down at the bottom, near the little finger. The blade and the bowl are the bit you hold. Dress for the occasion. If it' a black tie, don't wear shorts. If it' casual, don't wear a suit. Ask about it. Waiters love explaining things, and you' look smart. If you want a taste, order something simple they describe, like pasta with pesto. Most places will let you switch it for free.",
